Article 2 (Preparation and Management of Minutes) The Special Committee on Agriculture, Fisheries and Rural Communities established under Article 2 (1) of the Act on the Establishment and Operation of the Special Committee on Agriculture, Fisheries and Rural Communities (hereinafter referred to as the "Act" and the "Committee", respectively) shall record the following matters in the minutes of its meetings and manage and preserve such minutes pursuant to the Public Records Management Act:
1. The date, time, and place of the meeting, and whether it was open to the public;
2. A list of members in attendance;
3. Details of agenda items submitted and the results of consultations;
4. Other major matters discussed.
